---
import PrivateAppLayout from '../../layouts/PrivateAppLayout.astro';
---
<PrivateAppLayout title="Trade Avata — Maintenance"><main class="maintenance"><div class="mark">TRADE AVATA</div><h1>We’ll be back shortly.</h1><p>Trade Avata is temporarily unavailable while maintenance is in progress.</p><small>Authorized administrators can continue working from the private admin area.</small></main></PrivateAppLayout>
<style is:global>.maintenance{min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;padding:28px}.mark{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--app-accent-2);font-weight:800}.maintenance h1{font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,76px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:18px 0}.maintenance p,.maintenance small{color:var(--app-muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:620px;margin:0 auto}</style>
